    "title": "Air Force member creates dog treat business while serving country - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Steve Harris ,\n7 hours ago BELLEVILLE, Ill. (First Alert 4) - An active duty Air Force member has launched a dog treat business that connects her military service with her love of animals. Ameera McRea, an Air Force flight attendant, created Combat Chow four years ago after wanting to make treats for her dog Paige. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
